# A water molecule in implicit water with 0.5 M NaF (the user guide's example input)
lattice Cubic 15
coords-type Cartesian
ion O   0.00  0.00  0.00  0
ion H   1.43  1.11  0.00  1
ion H  -1.43  1.11  0.00  1
ion-species GBRV/$ID_pbe.uspp

elec-ex-corr gga-PBE
elec-cutoff 20 100
coulomb-interaction Isolated
coulomb-truncation-embed 0 0 0

fluid LinearPCM
pcm-variant CANDLE
fluid-solvent H2O
fluid-cation Na+ 0.5
fluid-anion F- 0.5

ionic-minimize nIterations 10
dump End State ElecDensity
